{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-f-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜原生流程已编码，完整构建通过\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段]] · [[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|主流程]]\nGA 蓝图与动画接线待完成，尚未运行验收。窗口内立即换段；第三段后重新起手。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 首次按下\nASC::ProcessAbilityInput → ActivateAbility。\n校验 → CommitAbility → StartStep(0)。\n忽略激活键的已按下状态。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-main",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. StartStep(i) → Main\n关闭旧 Trace/窗口，解绑旧任务。\nASC PlayMontage(Main, Rate)。\n默认 Main → 对应 End。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. WaitComboInput → HandleInputPressed\n发送 SourceStep + RequestId，先消费 GAS 事件。\n拒绝旧请求号、错误段、已关窗或终段。\n否则刷新唯一 Pending 与有效期。\nTryAdvanceCombo()",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. NotifyState → HandleMontageEvent\n无 ASC: 预览静默返回，游戏世界警告。\n有 ASC: Task 验 Montage/实例/所有权，GA 验主 Mesh。\nBegin → 开窗并 TryAdvanceCombo。\nEnd → 关窗、清缓存、拒绝待处理请求。\nHitWindow 独立且服务器判定。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-branch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. TryAdvanceCombo\nif 开窗 && Pending未过期 && next有效:\n  消费 Pending → StartStep(next)\nelse: 保持 Main/End\n每请求最多推进一段。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 没有合法后续请求\nMain → End → OnCompleted → EndAbility。\n第三段不循环。\n下次按下重新激活第一段。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-clean",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "结束 / 中断 / 取消\nEndAbility → 清 Trace/窗口/缓存/任务/兜底计时器。\n服务器恢复 Mesh Tick/URO。\n基类释放组与相机覆盖。\n旧通知不得污染新段。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-correct",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "权威确认 / 拒绝\n服务器 SendAuthoritativeStep → ASC ClientCorrectComboStep。\n匹配预测键及新 Revision 才调用 CorrectPredictedStep。\n拒绝清缓存并 StartStep(服务器段,位置)，恢复窗口。\n旧接受通知不撤销较新的客户端预测。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-start",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-start",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "combo-f-main",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "StartStep(0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-input",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-main",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "combo-f-input",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "活跃期的新按下"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-window",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-input",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "combo-f-window",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "接收动画窗口"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-eval",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-window",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "combo-f-branch",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "检查请求"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-next",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-branch",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "combo-f-main",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "合法下一段"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-end",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-branch",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "combo-f-end",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "不满足 → 默认收尾"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-clean",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-branch",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "combo-f-clean",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "取消/播放失败"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-finish",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-end",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "combo-f-clean",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "自然完成清理"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-fe-correct",
      "fromNode": "combo-f-input",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "combo-f-correct",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "请求处理结果 → 可靠纠正"
    }
  ]
}
